# Every pattern here is anchored with a leading slash, and that is load-bearing.
#
# `.vercelignore` matches like `.gitignore`: an unanchored `clients/` matches a
# directory of that name at ANY depth. It was meant to drop the seed YAML at
# the repo root, and it was also silently dropping
# public/verticals/realestate/clients/ — 2,050 property photographs, 200 MB —
# so every listing on the deployed site rendered an empty gallery while the
# database happily served the correct image paths.

# Inputs the import scripts read, not the app. Nothing under app/, lib/ or
# components/ imports them, so they only inflate every upload.
/source-data/

# Seed content and one-off scripts. The database is what the site reads at
# runtime; these are how rows get there.
/scripts/
/clients/
/drizzle/

# Repo docs
/SETUP-PROMPT.md
